<%- include('layout-header') %>

<h2>Welcome to Core Banking Dashboard</h2>
<p>Hello, <strong><%= fullName %></strong>! Your session is active.</p>

<div style="background: #eef; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #003366; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <h4 style="margin-top: 0;">Session Profile (Sourced from insecure client cookies)</h4>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>User ID:</strong> <code><%= userId %></code></li>
        <li><strong>Username:</strong> <code><%= username %></code></li>
        <li><strong>Access Role:</strong> <code><%= role %></code></li>
    </ul>
    <p><small><em>Security Note: Because session state resides in plaintext client cookies, you can use your browser's developer tools (Application -> Cookies) to alter your <code>userId</code> or <code>role</code> to instantly hijack other user sessions or elevate permissions!</em></small></p>
</div>

<h3>Core Actions</h3>
